  "title": "The Siege of Xiapi",
  "place": "Xiapi, on the lower Si",
  "blurb": [
    "Lu Bu has run out of friends. Cao Cao and Liu Bei have driven him into Xiapi, a walled town on the low ground where the Si and the Yi come together, and the siege is two months old. Cao Cao's engineers have cut the dykes upstream.",
    "The water will come in three tides, outermost fields first, and every field it covers becomes shallows: slow to cross, easy to strike a man standing in. The old dyke road is the only dry way to the west gate. Get the army onto it, or onto the ridge behind it, before the water decides for you."
  ],
